13339      /* STAT-RMSTREG-002: RMSTREG — Restricted mean survival time regression estimation
13340       * Source: S154 / Chapter 106 / `Getting Started: RMSTREG Procedure` (PDF pp. 8731–8735); S154 / Chapter 106 / `Overview: RMSTREG Procedure` (PDF
13340    ! pp. 8730–8731).
