13349    !                                         quit;


13350      ods path work.templat(update) sashelp.tmplmst(read);
13351      
13352      data survival; call streaminit(218); do id=1 to 100; age=25+mod(id*7,40); x=mod(id,2); time=exp(0.5+0.15*x+0.01*age+rand('normal')*0.7);
13352    ! status=(mod(id,4) ne 0); output; end; run;

NOTE: The data set WORK.SURVIVAL has 100 observations and 5 variables.

13353      proc rmstreg data=survival tau=5; model time*status(0)=age x / link=linear method=pv; run;

NOTE: Algorithm converged.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE RMSTREG printed page 1035.

